    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the work though. it's everything. i feel like i've let everyone down. my parents, my department, my peers... i've wasted so much time and money on a lie. every time i think about tomorrow, i just feel this massive sense of shame. like there's no way to ever come back from this. i feel like a ghost walking around my own life.",
